WEBVTT

NOTE
The introduction films share the same instrumental music, without speech.
Source and timing: videos/guteneo-film/public/audio/vertical-provenance.md.

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Instrumental music: an opening chord and an electric piano motif.

00:03.000 --> 00:23.000
Bass and percussion join the music, with short whooshes at scene changes.

00:23.000 --> 00:40.000
The music continues, punctuated by percussion and rustling paper.

00:40.000 --> 00:44.000
The music becomes lighter.

00:44.000 --> 00:49.000
The rhythm and melody build again.

00:49.000 --> 00:51.000
The rhythm gradually softens; a gentle whoosh accompanies the transition.

00:51.000 --> 00:55.100
A final chord resonates, without percussion.

00:55.100 --> 00:56.000
The music gently fades away.
